			"notes": "**Minecraft 26.3 support.** Builder's Shulkers now runs on Minecraft 26.3, on Fabric and on NeoForge, alongside 26.1.x, 26.2 and the 1.21.x line.\n\n**Litematica easy place compatibility.** With easy place turned on, Pocket-Build now builds straight from the box in your hand: it takes whichever slot holds the block the schematic asks for, block by block, so one shulker works as a material palette for a whole build. Until now easy place refused to place anything while you held a box and answered \"Action prevented by the Easy Place mode\" on every click.\n\nFixed the Pocket-Build scroll stopping twice on the same item when the first and last filled slot of a shulker holds that item.\n\nDownload the jar for your loader and your Minecraft version, then put it in your `mods` folder. Fabric jars need Fabric Loader and Fabric API (in `mods` too); NeoForge jars need NeoForge only.\n- Minecraft 26.1.x, 26.2 or 26.3: Java 25.\n- Minecraft 1.21.9 to 1.21.11: Java 21.\n\nEach jar is built on GitHub Actions from this release and carries a signed SLSA build-provenance attestation. Verify the jar you downloaded (`<loader>` is fabric or neoforge, `<mc_version>` one of: 1.21.11, 1.21.9-1.21.10, 26.1.x, 26.2, 26.3):\n```\ngh attestation verify builders-shulkers-1.2.4-<loader>-<mc_version>.jar --repo Moncef-dev/builders-shulkers\n```"
		},
