			"notes": "**NeoForge support.** Builder's Shulkers now runs on NeoForge as well as Fabric, on every supported Minecraft version. Both loaders behave identically and can play together on the same server.\n\n**Rendering fixes inside the box.** Fixed the lighting of 2D items and some blocks when rendered inside a shulker box, and fixed some position and orientation issues.\n\nThe Pocket-Build opening and closing is now more reactive.\n\nDownload the jar for your loader and your Minecraft version, then put it in your `mods` folder. Fabric jars need Fabric Loader and Fabric API (in `mods` too); NeoForge jars need NeoForge only.\n- Minecraft 26.1.x or 26.2: Java 25.\n- Minecraft 1.21.9 to 1.21.11: Java 21.\n\nEach jar is built on GitHub Actions from this release and carries a signed SLSA build-provenance attestation. Verify the jar you downloaded (`<loader>` is fabric or neoforge, `<mc_version>` one of: 1.21.11, 1.21.9-1.21.10, 26.1.x, 26.2):\n```\ngh attestation verify builders-shulkers-1.2.3-<loader>-<mc_version>.jar --repo Moncef-dev/builders-shulkers\n```"
		},
