			"notes": "The mod now runs on Minecraft 26.2 as well as 26.1.2.\n\nIf you also have Litematica installed, middle-clicking one of its schematic ghost blocks while in Pocket-Build selects that block from the shulker you are holding, the same way middle-clicking a real block does (if you do not have it in the box, it is picked from your inventory as usual).\n\nRequires Minecraft 26.1.2 or 26.2 with Fabric Loader, Fabric API, and Java 25. Put the jar for your Minecraft version (`builders-shulkers-1.1.5-fabric-<mc_version>.jar`) and Fabric API in your `mods` folder.\n\nThe jar is built on GitHub Actions from this tag and carries a signed SLSA build-provenance attestation:\n```\ngh attestation verify builders-shulkers-1.1.5-fabric-<mc_version>.jar --repo Moncef-dev/builders-shulkers\n```"
